# Contact form — Formspree endpoint ID.
# Create a form at https://formspree.io, then copy the ID from the endpoint URL
# (https://formspree.io/f/XXXXXXXX  ->  XXXXXXXX) and set it here.
# Without this the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=

# Optional: a GitHub personal access token (public_repo scope is enough).
# Only raises the GitHub API rate limit for local development — never commit a
# real value, and do not set this in Vercel: it would ship to the client.
VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=
